      "content": "it's just that there's nothing left to grieve. the person i was is just... gone. i feel like i'm just waiting around for a life to start that's already over. it's like looking at a book where the last hundred pages were ripped out. the story is finished, you know? so why am i still sitting here reading the blank pages?",
